
=== voidwolf ===
Hostname is "voidwolf". Graphical session is startx only (no display manager).

  1. Log in as the live user (see ISO-README).
  2. Ensure PATH has ~/.local/bin if you rebuild suckless as user.
  3. startx

After install, run on the target system:
  - ./bootstrap/repos.sh          # XLibre + vw-repo keys (fail-closed)
  - voidwolf-theme set voidwolf-dark
  - docs: /usr/share/voidwolf/ISO-README and https://github.com/GraeWolf/voidwolf

No full-disk encryption story in this installer (design non-goal).

